00:56:51.680 --> 00:56:53.260
<v Tracy Wilson>Aww, man, that was cold.
<v Tracy Wilson>噢，伙计，那太冷血了。

00:56:53.260 --> 00:56:58.260
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
